  "limitations": [
    "The verifier checks supplied external anchor values but cannot prove that their channel is independent or that a custodian did not conceal a fork.",
    "Version 1.1 accepts synthetic conformance releases only; non-synthetic private releases fail closed until a separately reviewed full-candidate and external-ledger activation is implemented.",
    "The release scanner rejects strict-schema violations and configured sensitive patterns; it is not a universal PII or steganography detector.",
